---

Protocol note: this project implements an unofficial compatibility layer against
Uptime Kuma's internal client protocol. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by or
supported by the Uptime Kuma or OpenStatus projects. Wire formats implemented here
were derived by reading the Uptime Kuma 2.5.0-2.5.5 and OpenStatus source trees; no
source code was copied from either. See docs/protocol-research.md for the exact
versions, files and line references relied upon.